《Cat Translator 》is a pet Teaser designed for pet lovers.

With this translator, you can easily play with your pet. With him, the relationship between owners and pets can be closer and smoother! From now on, don't worry about pets not being close to you!

"Features"

"Cat dog language translation": Featured translation function, more convenient and smooth interaction with pet;

"Cat Teaser artifact": a large number of meow star people's audio for you to play and interact with your meow star people;

"Dog pulling artifact": a large amount of dog audio for you to play and interact with your pet;

"Pet diary": it is convenient for you to record the daily life of your pet and witness the growth of your pet anytime and anywhere!
